<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian companies ex-dividend today.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian companies ex-dividend today.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following companies are ex-dividend today, according to the Australian Stock Exchange:</p>
<p>    Coles Myer			10.0 cents</p>
<p>    Embelton			   3.0 cents</p>
<p>    Gibson Chemical Industries  14.0 cents</p>
<p>    Linden &amp; Conway		 30.0 cents</p>
<p>    Joe White Maltings	    14.0 cents</p>
<p>    Woodside Petroleum	     6.0 cents</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
